@startuml
!theme plain
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Card Acquiring & Processing — Synthetic Component HLD
actor Shopper
component "Merchant Checkout" as Checkout
component "Merchant Backend" as Merchant
package "Gateway / Orchestration" {
 component "Payment API Gateway" as Gateway
 component "Payment Orchestrator" as Orchestrator
 component "Tokenization Boundary" as Vault
 component "Acquiring Processor Adapter" as Adapter
 component "Webhook Outbox" as Outbox
 component "Recovery / Reversal" as Recovery
 component "Capture and Presentment" as Capture
 component "Reconciliation" as Recon
 database "Intent / Attempt Store" as Store
}
component "Acquirer / Processing Switch" as Acquirer
cloud "Card Network" as Network
component "Issuer" as Issuer
Shopper --> Checkout : checkout
Checkout --> Merchant : order
Merchant --> Gateway : payment intent
Gateway --> Vault : token reference only
Gateway --> Orchestrator : validated request
Orchestrator --> Store : persist attempt / state
Orchestrator --> Adapter : route authorization
Adapter --> Acquirer : authorization request
Acquirer --> Network : network message
Network --> Issuer : issuer authorization
Issuer --> Network : decision
Network --> Acquirer : network response
Acquirer --> Adapter : result / processing reference
Adapter --> Orchestrator : mapped decision
Orchestrator --> Outbox : merchant event
Outbox ..> Merchant : webhook
Recovery ..> Acquirer : status inquiry / conditional reversal
Orchestrator --> Capture : eligible capture
Capture --> Acquirer : presentment per contract
Recon ..> Acquirer : reports / settlement records
Recon --> Store : record match / exceptions
note bottom of Acquirer
Network-specific ISO 8583 messages are out of scope
for this generic component diagram.
end note
@enduml